<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">companion-unstick</ansi>

If your bonded companion ever seems stuck, standing still when it should be
walking, not answering, or caught on something it cannot finish, this puts
it right. It clears what the companion was in the middle of and nothing else:
its memories, its feelings about you and its belongings are untouched. You
can use it about once a minute.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Usage ━━━</ansi>

::rows
  <ansi fg="command">companion-unstick</ansi>    Reset your bonded companion.
::
